     5	
     6	  // Loop invariant: ACC is the already-produced prefix, I is the next even
     7	  // index, and OVS is the unconsumed iterator suffix.  append mutates the
     8	  // result object in place, so the loop performs no fresh allocation.
     9	  claim [loop-correct]:
    10	    <k>
    11	      #iterNext(list(OVS))
    12	      ~> #loopStep(Name("odd"), loopBody)
    13	      ~> K
    14	    =>
    15	      K
